  "content": "\n\n<p>如需此模組的數據包版本，請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<p>為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a> 新增更多 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Delight</a> 砧板切割食譜</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支援所有木材類型的剝皮、去樹皮與回收功能</li>\n<li>從一格高的花朵中獲取更多染料</li>\n<li>玫瑰石英方塊可分解為玫瑰石英碎塊</li>\n<li>（最高支援 1.19.2）泥磚可分解為單個泥磚</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花朵切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/rosequartzcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"玫瑰石英切割\"></p>\n<p>想要將所有 Farmer's Cutting 內容整合為單一模組嗎？請查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Farmer's Cutting Collection</a></p>",
